    "body": "I'm a little unsure we should use the return type that way, especially given how its counterpart in ES seems to be bespoke iterators (e.g. MapIterator and friends). I might just disallow it as a return type altogether? Although then it's just very unusual since we have no precedent for such asymmetry...",
