    "body": "I'd be fine with that; I'm only talking about the return type *because* of symmetry with `sequence<>`.  In any case, we can always start with the one that has justification and add the rest later.\r\n\r\nHm, does anyone *besides* Map return the equivalent of a pair-sequence?",
