    "updated_at": "2019-07-16T23:01:32Z",
    "body": "This is likely interesting to WebGPU as well. We don't have anything that uses a pattern like this right now, but there are places where we might like to.\r\n\r\n> Hm, does anyone _besides_ Map return the equivalent of a pair-sequence?\r\n\r\n`Object.entries()`, I think. Being able to express this also allows a user to explicitly write the pair-sequence, which is the same type accepted by `Map`'s constructor.",
